#: ../../dartpy/user_guide/examples.rst:2 bb828634f1b44b5cadfa7296eb7e2d05
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "예제"

#: ../../dartpy/user_guide/examples.rst:4 4156ecc1c2a14ea18b2dc0694d558b52
msgid ""
"Once you have installed dartpy using pip install -U dartpy, you can run "
"the following \"Hello World\" example to simulate a 6-DOF robot using "
"DART."
msgstr ""
"pip install -U dartpy를 사용하여 dartpy를 설치한 후, 다음 \"Hello World\" 예제를 실행하여 "
"DART를 사용한 6-DOF 로봇 시뮬레이션을 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../dartpy/user_guide/examples.rst:8 c5289f7a95254114abf3fd07f9cecf45
msgid ""
"In order to load the URDF, please clone dart repository and set the "
"`DART_DATA_LOCAL_PATH` environment variable to where the `data` folder is"
" in the cloned repository (e.g., `C:/ws/dart/data/` if cloned to "
"`C:/ws/dart/`)"
msgstr ""
"URDF를 로드하려면 dart 저장소를 복제하고 `DART_DATA_LOCAL_PATH` 환경 변수를 복제된 저장소의 `data` "
"폴더 위치로 설정하세요 (예: `C:/ws/dart/`에 복제한 경우 `C:/ws/dart/data/`)"

#: ../../dartpy/user_guide/examples.rst:36 ac8279146d204f9f923c9ee02b1b9977
msgid ""
"When you run this script, it will perform a forward dynamic simulation of"
" the 6-DOF robot for 100 steps. Joint angles are printed every 10 steps, "
